  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a projectile is $y=\\sqrt{3} x-\\frac{g x^{2}}{2}$ The angle of projection is given by",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "lIG1e",
      "text": "$\\tan \\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ttpGs",
      "text": "$\\tan \\theta=\\sqrt{3}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UxER8",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WR5aL",
      "text": "zero.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Comparing the given equation with\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{y}=\\mathrm{x} \\tan \\theta-\\frac{\\mathrm{gx}^{2}}{2 \\mathrm{u}^{2} \\cos ^{2} \\theta}, \\text { we get }$\r\n\r\n$\\tan \\theta=\\sqrt{3}$",
